1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,779
Raat 8 baje ke baad 500 ka note kya ban gaya?

2
00:00:03,779 --> 00:00:07,214
Sirf kaagaz ka ek tukda. 8 November 2016 ki raat,

3
00:00:07,214 --> 00:00:08,589
TV par announcement aaya.

4
00:00:08,589 --> 00:00:12,367
Aadhi raat se 500 aur usse bade purane note chalna band.

5
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:14,429
Ghar ke drawer mein rakha paisa,

6
00:00:14,429 --> 00:00:16,490
ek jhatke mein sawaal ban gaya.

7
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,799
Socho ek normal ghar.

8
00:00:17,799 --> 00:00:21,399
Mummy ne rasoi ke dabbe mein kuch note chhupa rakhe the.

9
00:00:21,399 --> 00:00:24,671
Papa ki almari mein shaadi ke liye bachaya cash tha.

10
00:00:24,671 --> 00:00:26,962
Dono ne ek doosre ki taraf dekha.

11
00:00:26,962 --> 00:00:29,580
Kisi ko samajh nahi aaya, ab kya karein.

12
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,875
Yeh chhoti baat nahi thi. RBI ke hisaab se,

13
00:00:32,875 --> 00:00:37,634
us raat bazaar mein chal rahe noton ki value ka lagbhag 86 percent,

14
00:00:37,634 --> 00:00:41,661
ek saath kaanooni note nahi raha. Kaanooni note yaani legal tender,

15
00:00:41,661 --> 00:00:44,590
jise lene se koi mana nahi kar sakta.

16
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:48,500
Matlab bazaar ka zyada tar paisa ek raat mein ruk gaya.

17
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,633
Doodh wala, sabzi wala, auto wala,

18
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:54,187
sabke haath mein wahi bade note the. Aur agli subah,

19
00:00:54,187 --> 00:00:56,320
sabko kharcha toh karna hi tha.

20
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:59,136
Aaj yeh kahani poori sunenge. Pehla sawaal,

21
00:00:59,136 --> 00:01:03,158
queue ke un mahino mein aam family ne kya jhela?

22
00:01:03,158 --> 00:01:05,974
Doosra sawaal, RBI ne jab note gine,

23
00:01:05,974 --> 00:01:08,790
toh kitna paisa wapas aaya? Teesra sawaal,

24
00:01:08,790 --> 00:01:12,410
is jhatke ne hamari paise ki aadat kaise badli?

25
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:15,634
Chaliye pehle sawaal se shuru karte hain. Agli subah,

26
00:01:15,634 --> 00:01:18,500
shehar ke har bank ke bahar line thi.

27
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:22,083
Line itni lambi ki gali ke mod tak pahunch jaaye.

28
00:01:22,083 --> 00:01:24,590
Log nashta chhod kar, chappal pehen kar,

29
00:01:24,590 --> 00:01:26,740
bas line mein khade ho gaye.

30
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:29,778
Papa bhi gaye. Haath mein purane noton ka thaila,

31
00:01:29,778 --> 00:01:33,154
aur ek file mein ID ki photocopy. Unhe laga tha,

32
00:01:33,154 --> 00:01:36,867
ek ghante mein kaam ho jaayega. Shaam ko jab ghar laute,

33
00:01:36,867 --> 00:01:39,230
tab bhi kaam aadha hi hua tha.

34
00:01:39,230 --> 00:01:42,801
Bank ke andar BANK UNCLE ka haal bhi bura tha.

35
00:01:42,801 --> 00:01:45,658
Har aadmi ke sawaal, har aadmi ki jaldi.

36
00:01:45,658 --> 00:01:48,158
Paisa nikalne aur badalne par limit thi.

37
00:01:48,158 --> 00:01:51,014
Yaani aap apna hi paisa, apni marzi se,

38
00:01:51,014 --> 00:01:52,800
poora nahi nikaal sakte the.

39
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,402
ATM ki kahani aur ajeeb thi. Kai ATM khaali, kai band.

40
00:01:56,402 --> 00:01:59,676
Jahan cash aaya, wahan khabar aag ki tarah phail gayi.

41
00:01:59,676 --> 00:02:03,605
Log raat ko bhi phone karke ek doosre ko bata rahe the,

42
00:02:03,605 --> 00:02:05,570
us wale ATM mein paisa hai.

43
00:02:05,570 --> 00:02:08,637
RBI ka kaam ab ek race ban gaya tha.

44
00:02:08,637 --> 00:02:12,045
Press mein naye note chhapna, unhe currency chests tak bhejna,

45
00:02:12,045 --> 00:02:15,794
phir bank aur ATM tak. Currency chest yaani woh bade godaam,

46
00:02:15,794 --> 00:02:18,180
jahan banks ka cash rakha jaata hai.

47
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:19,797
Ghar mein bhi tension thi.

48
00:02:19,797 --> 00:02:22,708
Mummy ke dabbe wale note bhi jama karne the.

49
00:02:22,708 --> 00:02:24,972
Unhe darr tha ki bank wale poochenge,

50
00:02:24,972 --> 00:02:26,589
itna paisa kahan se aaya.

51
00:02:26,589 --> 00:02:28,853
Bade deposit par sawaal ho sakte the,

52
00:02:28,853 --> 00:02:30,470
yeh baat sabne suni thi.

53
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:32,362
Yahan ek baat samajhne wali hai.

54
00:02:32,362 --> 00:02:34,568
Mummy ka paisa chori ka nahi tha.

55
00:02:34,568 --> 00:02:38,036
Woh saalon ki chhoti bachat thi, sabzi ke paison se bachayi.

56
00:02:38,036 --> 00:02:40,243
Par cash ka koi record nahi hota,

57
00:02:40,243 --> 00:02:43,080
isliye seedhi bachat bhi us waqt shaq mein lagi.

58
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,337
Ab chaliye mohalle ki kirana dukaan par.

59
00:02:45,337 --> 00:02:48,238
SHOPKEEPER ki dukaan udhaar aur cash par chalti thi.

60
00:02:48,238 --> 00:02:50,817
Har din ka hisaab ek moti diary mein.

61
00:02:50,817 --> 00:02:52,751
Note ban ke baad pehle hafte,

62
00:02:52,751 --> 00:02:55,330
galle mein chhutte paise lagbhag khatam ho gaye.

63
00:02:55,330 --> 00:02:59,257
Grahak aate, 500 ka purana note dikhate. Shopkeeper sir hilata,

64
00:02:59,257 --> 00:03:03,184
bhai yeh nahi chalega. Kuch log naya bada note laate,

65
00:03:03,184 --> 00:03:07,504
toh chhutta nahi hota. Saamaan dukaan mein tha, grahak bhi tha,

66
00:03:07,504 --> 00:03:09,860
par len-den beech mein atak gaya.

67
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:11,531
Toh shopkeeper ne kya kiya?

68
00:03:11,531 --> 00:03:15,208
Wahi jo hamare desh mein hamesha hota hai. Diary khol di.

69
00:03:15,208 --> 00:03:18,550
Jaan pehchaan walon ko udhaar dena shuru kiya. Usne socha,

70
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:21,225
rishta bana rahega, paisa baad mein aa jaayega.

71
00:03:21,225 --> 00:03:23,230
Us waqt yeh sahi bhi laga.

72
00:03:23,230 --> 00:03:24,666
Par udhaar ka matlab hai,

73
00:03:24,666 --> 00:03:27,251
dukaandaar khud bina paise ke maal de raha hai.

74
00:03:27,251 --> 00:03:29,549
Use wholesale wale ko toh cash dena hai.

75
00:03:29,549 --> 00:03:32,135
Toh beech ka dabaav uski apni jeb par aaya.

76
00:03:32,135 --> 00:03:34,720
Chhoti dukaan ke liye yeh mahino ka jhatka tha.

77
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,947
Isi waqt ek aur cheez hui.

78
00:03:36,947 --> 00:03:39,917
Kuch dukaanon par ek kaagaz chipka dikhne laga,

79
00:03:39,917 --> 00:03:41,774
ek QR code ke saath.

80
00:03:41,774 --> 00:03:45,857
Pehli baar kai dukaandaaron ne phone se paisa lena shuru kiya.

81
00:03:45,857 --> 00:03:49,570
Shuruaat mein woh bhi darte the, paisa sach mein aayega?

82
00:03:49,570 --> 00:03:51,869
Bhai ne shopkeeper ko samjhaya, chacha,

83
00:03:51,869 --> 00:03:54,934
phone pe paisa seedha bank mein jaata hai.

84
00:03:54,934 --> 00:03:58,765
Chhutte ka jhanjhat khatam. Shopkeeper ne dheere se haan kaha.

85
00:03:58,765 --> 00:04:02,980
Pehla payment aaya, aur uske chehre par halki si muskaan aayi.

86
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:06,053
Par sabke liye yeh aasan nahi tha. Gaon mein,

87
00:04:06,053 --> 00:04:09,808
ya bujurgon ke liye, smartphone aur bank app nayi cheez thi.

88
00:04:09,808 --> 00:04:12,880
Jo log roz ki kamai cash mein lete the,

89
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:15,270
unke liye yeh mahine sabse mushkil rahe.

90
00:04:15,270 --> 00:04:17,487
Ab doosra sawaal, sabse bada sawaal.

91
00:04:17,487 --> 00:04:20,443
Jab sab note bank mein wapas aa gaye,

92
00:04:20,443 --> 00:04:23,768
RBI ne unhe gina. Yeh ginti aasan nahi thi.

93
00:04:23,768 --> 00:04:27,463
Dher saare note, machine mein, ek ek karke check hue.

94
00:04:27,463 --> 00:04:29,680
Nakli toh nahi, sahi toh hai.

95
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,751
Shuru mein bahut logon ko laga tha,

96
00:04:31,751 --> 00:04:33,526
ek bada hissa wapas nahi aayega.

97
00:04:33,526 --> 00:04:36,484
Soch yeh thi ki jinke paas chhupa hua paisa hai,

98
00:04:36,484 --> 00:04:37,963
woh bank aane se darenge.

99
00:04:37,963 --> 00:04:40,330
Aur woh note bas wahin khatam ho jaayenge.

100
00:04:40,330 --> 00:04:44,029
Phir RBI ka final hisaab aaya. Jitne note band hue the,

101
00:04:44,029 --> 00:04:47,056
unme se lagbhag saare bank mein wapas aa gaye.

102
00:04:47,056 --> 00:04:49,410
Matlab qareeb qareeb poora paisa laut aaya.

103
00:04:49,410 --> 00:04:52,100
Bahut thoda sa hissa hi bahar reh gaya.

104
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:53,788
Iska seedha matlab kya hai?

105
00:04:53,788 --> 00:04:57,164
Noton ke roop mein koi bada chhupa dher nahi mila.

106
00:04:57,164 --> 00:05:00,877
Log apna paisa kisi na kisi tarah bank tak le aaye.

107
00:05:00,877 --> 00:05:04,590
Shuru ki soch ko, aakhri number ne ek alag tasveer dikhayi.

108
00:05:04,590 --> 00:05:07,106
Par is wapsi ka ek aur asar hua,

109
00:05:07,106 --> 00:05:08,679
jo kam log jaante hain.

110
00:05:08,679 --> 00:05:11,195
Itna saara paisa ek saath bank mein aaya,

111
00:05:11,195 --> 00:05:13,082
bachat khaate aur current account mein.

112
00:05:13,082 --> 00:05:15,284
Bank ke liye yeh sasta paisa tha,

113
00:05:15,284 --> 00:05:17,800
kyunki is par byaaj kam dena padta hai.

114
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,002
Jab bank ke paas sasta paisa ho,

115
00:05:20,002 --> 00:05:23,461
toh woh loan bhi sasta de sakta hai. RBI ke mutabik,

116
00:05:23,461 --> 00:05:28,494
banks ne saal bhar wale loan ke apne byaaj mein 100 basis points ki katauti ki.

117
00:05:28,494 --> 00:05:31,010
Basis point byaaj naapne ki chhoti ikai hai.

118
00:05:31,010 --> 00:05:31,995
Iska fayda kisko?

119
00:05:31,995 --> 00:05:34,952
Jinka home loan ya car loan chal raha tha.

120
00:05:34,952 --> 00:05:37,579
Byaaj ghatne se EMI halki ho sakti thi.

121
00:05:37,579 --> 00:05:39,878
Matlab jo family queue mein khadi thi,

122
00:05:39,878 --> 00:05:42,835
usi ki EMI par baad mein thodi raahat aayi.

123
00:05:42,835 --> 00:05:43,820
Ajeeb hai na?

124
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:47,304
Ab teesra sawaal. Is jhatke ne hamari aadat kaise badli?

125
00:05:47,304 --> 00:05:49,394
Jawab aaj aapki jeb mein hai.

126
00:05:49,394 --> 00:05:52,181
Chai ki tapri ho ya sabzi ka thela,

127
00:05:52,181 --> 00:05:53,923
har jagah woh QR code.

128
00:05:53,923 --> 00:05:56,710
Par yeh badlaav ek din mein nahi aaya.

129
00:05:56,710 --> 00:05:59,364
Business Standard ki report ke mutabik,

130
00:05:59,364 --> 00:06:02,018
NPCI ke data ke hisaab se,

131
00:06:02,018 --> 00:06:07,327
FY17 mein UPI se poore saal mein sirf 17.8 million transactions hue.

132
00:06:07,327 --> 00:06:10,866
NPCI yaani woh sanstha jo UPI chalati hai.

133
00:06:10,866 --> 00:06:13,520
FY yaani sarkari hisaab ka saal.

134
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:18,311
Aur FY26 tak? Yeh number 241.62 billion transactions tak pahunch gaya.

135
00:06:18,311 --> 00:06:20,489
Yeh hazaaron guna badhat hai.

136
00:06:20,489 --> 00:06:24,410
Matlab jo cheez gine chune log use karte the,

137
00:06:24,410 --> 00:06:28,330
woh ab har ghar ki roz ki aadat hai.

138
00:06:28,330 --> 00:06:30,517
Par report ek aur baat kehti hai.

139
00:06:30,517 --> 00:06:33,329
Cash poori tarah gaya nahi. Report ke hisaab se,

140
00:06:33,329 --> 00:06:37,078
India ki cash wali aadat UPI ke boom mein bhi bachi rahi.

141
00:06:37,078 --> 00:06:38,953
Log phone se bhi dete hain,

142
00:06:38,953 --> 00:06:41,140
aur almari mein cash bhi rakhte hain.

143
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:44,586
Ab woh galti jo bahut log karte hain. Kuch sochte hain,

144
00:06:44,586 --> 00:06:47,405
ab sab UPI hai, cash ki zaroorat hi nahi.

145
00:06:47,405 --> 00:06:50,538
Kuch aaj bhi sochte hain, cash hi asli paisa hai,

146
00:06:50,538 --> 00:06:53,670
bank pe bharosa nahi. Dono soch ek hi galti hain.

147
00:06:53,670 --> 00:06:57,262
Kyun? Kyunki 2016 ne dikhaya ki sirf cash rakhna khatra hai.

148
00:06:57,262 --> 00:06:59,875
Ek raat mein aapka cash atak sakta hai.

149
00:06:59,875 --> 00:07:03,141
Aur sirf digital pe rehna bhi khatra hai. Network gaya,

150
00:07:03,141 --> 00:07:06,080
server down, battery khatam, toh aap bhi atak gaye.

151
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:09,834
Ab WIFE ki baat suniye, jo ghar ka budget chalati hai.

152
00:07:09,834 --> 00:07:12,223
Unhone 2016 se ek seedha niyam banaya.

153
00:07:12,223 --> 00:07:13,929
Rozana ka kharcha phone se.

154
00:07:13,929 --> 00:07:16,318
Par ghar mein thoda sa cash hamesha,

155
00:07:16,318 --> 00:07:19,730
bas itna ki kuch din ka zaroori kharcha chal jaaye.

156
00:07:19,730 --> 00:07:23,503
Aur badi bachat ka paisa? Woh dabbe mein nahi, bank mein.

157
00:07:23,503 --> 00:07:27,275
Kyunki bank mein paisa record mein hai, byaaj bhi milta hai.

158
00:07:27,275 --> 00:07:29,333
Aur kal koi bhi niyam badle,

159
00:07:29,333 --> 00:07:32,420
aapke paas saboot hai ki yeh paisa aapka hai.

160
00:07:32,420 --> 00:07:34,226
Isko emergency cushion kehte hain.

161
00:07:34,226 --> 00:07:37,839
Emergency cushion yaani mushkil waqt ke liye alag rakha paisa.

162
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:41,813
Iska bada hissa bank khaate mein, jahan se turant nikal sake.

163
00:07:41,813 --> 00:07:43,981
Aur chhota hissa haath mein cash,

164
00:07:43,981 --> 00:07:46,510
jab bank ya network saath na de.

165
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:48,174
Ek aur sabak shopkeeper se.

166
00:07:48,174 --> 00:07:50,835
Jo dukaan cash aur QR dono leti hai,

167
00:07:50,835 --> 00:07:52,831
uske grahak khaali haath nahi lautte.

168
00:07:52,831 --> 00:07:55,493
Aapke ghar ke liye bhi yahi niyam hai.

169
00:07:55,493 --> 00:07:58,488
Ek raasta band ho, toh doosra khula rehna chahiye.

170
00:07:58,488 --> 00:08:00,151
Yeh investment advice nahi hai,

171
00:08:00,151 --> 00:08:02,480
bas ghar chalane ka samajhdaar tareeka hai.

172
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,750
Toh kahani ka hisaab yeh raha.

173
00:08:04,750 --> 00:08:10,427
8 November 2016 ko lagbhag 86 percent noton ki value ek raat mein band hui.

174
00:08:10,427 --> 00:08:13,832
Bank ki line, dukaan ka udhaar, ghar ka darr.

175
00:08:13,832 --> 00:08:16,103
Phir lagbhag saare note wapas aaye,

176
00:08:16,103 --> 00:08:19,130
aur phone se payment ki aadat ban gayi.

177
00:08:19,130 --> 00:08:20,929
Agli video mein ek aur kahani,

178
00:08:20,929 --> 00:08:23,627
jo seedhe aapke paise se judi hai. Tab tak,

179
00:08:23,627 --> 00:08:27,523
apne ghar ka cash aur digital ka balance ek baar check kar lijiye.

180
00:08:27,523 --> 00:08:29,322
Aur yeh video Papa ko bhejo,

181
00:08:29,322 --> 00:08:32,020
jo aaj bhi almari mein saara cash rakhte hain.

182
00:08:32,020 --> 00:08:35,382
Ab aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

183
00:08:35,382 --> 00:08:42,779
Note ban ke waqt aapke ghar mein sabse mushkil kya tha,

184
00:08:42,779 --> 00:08:48,158
bank ki line, ATM, ya dukaan par chhutta?

185
00:08:48,158 --> 00:08:51,520
Comment mein apni kahani likhiye.
